'''2010 Worlds Day 2 Dan Westergard LS Watch Your Step''' was the Light Side constructed list played by [[Dan Westergard]] at [[2010 World Championship]] (Day 2).

Deck name on sheet: A road too long to mention. Transcription note: sheet name "DAN" only - small-world rule: same event, same hand as p117 Dan Westergard; shorthand expanded only where unique

== Deck info ==

* '''Starting Card:''' [[Watch Your Step / This Place Can Be A Little Rough]]
* '''Format:''' [[Legacy Open]]
* '''Stage:''' Day 2

